## `setupServer`

The `setupServer` function is used to create a [MSW server](https://mswjs.io/docs/api/setup-server) that will intercept and mock HTTP requests. It accepts an array of [handlers](https://mswjs.io/docs/api/handlers), which are functions that define the mocked responses for specific requests.

